ite and application security. Expiry: Session Name: __Host-next-auth.csrf-token Vendor: www.tbrp.business.aau.dk Service: Microsoft Azure Purpose: Required for the website to perform properly. Privacy policy: Microsoft Azure -  Privacy policy Expiry: Session Name: ARRAffinitySameSite Vendor: .www.tbrp.business.aau.dk Service: Purpose: Ensures the website and application security. Expiry: Session Name: __Host-next-auth.csrf-token Vendor: www.en.search.aau.dk Service: Microsoft Azure Purpose: Required for the website to perform properly. Privacy policy: Microsoft Azure -  Privacy policy Expiry: Session Name: ARRAffinity Vendor: .www.en.search.aau.dk Service: Purpose: Ensures the website and application security. Expiry: Session Name: __Secure-next-auth.callback-url Vendor: www.en.search.aau.dk Service: Microsoft Azure Purpose: Required for the website to perform properly. Privacy policy: Microsoft Azure -  Privacy policy Expiry: Session Name: ARRAffinitySameSite Vendor: .www.en.search.aau.dk Service: Cookie Information Purpose: Supports the website's technical functions. Privacy policy: Cookie Information -  Privacy policy Expiry: a year Name: CookieInformationConsent Vendor: www.en.search.aau.dk Service: Microsoft Azure Purpose: Required for the website to perform properly. Privacy policy: Microsoft Azure -  Privacy policy Expiry: Session Name: ARRAffinitySameSite Vendor: .www.workenvironment.aau.dk Service: Purpose: Ensures the website and application security. Expiry: Session Name: __Secure-next-auth.callback-url Vendor: www.workenvironment.aau.dk Service: Cookie Information Purpose: Supports the website's technical functions. Privacy policy: Cookie Information -  Privacy policy Expiry: a year Name: CookieInformationConsent Vendor: www.workenvironment.aau.dk Service: Microsoft Azure Purpose: Required for the website to perform properly. Privacy policy: Microsoft Azure -  Privacy policy Expiry: Session Name: ARRAffinity Vendor: .www.workenvironment.aau.dk Service: P